---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Chip from '../components/chip.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<Layout 
	title="Project 2360 (Flowserract) | Vincent Sanicolas" 
	description="Flowserract: A generative native UI engine that parses natural language prompts to dynamically assemble and render Flutter widgets in real-time."
	showBack={true}
>
	<!-- Title Header with Links Below Subtitle -->
	<div data-snap="block" class="show-snap project-detail-header" data-snap-align="fill">
		<div class="header-content">
			<span class="project-mono-label">EXPERIMENTAL FRAMEWORK</span>
			<h1>PROJECT 2360 (FLOWSERRACT)</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Generative Native UI Engine</p>
			
			<div class="project-links">
				<Chip label="Flutter">
					<Icon name="simple-icons:flutter" slot="icon" />
				</Chip>
				<Chip label="Dart">
					<Icon name="simple-icons:dart" slot="icon" />
				</Chip>
				<Chip label="Supabase">
					<Icon name="simple-icons:supabase" slot="icon" />
				</Chip>
				<Chip 
					label="llm_json_stream" 
					href="/llm-json-stream"
				>
					<Icon name="simple-icons:typescript" slot="icon" />
				</Chip>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Centered Wider Content Container -->
	<div class="project-content-container">
		
		<!-- Overview with Inline Wrapping Image -->
		<div data-snap="block" class="show-snap section-block overview-section" data-snap-align="fill">
			<div class="overview-flow-wrapper">
				<div class="project-image-container hero-image-container">
					<img src="/images/project-2360-placeholder.png" alt="Flowserract Generative Native UI Engine Schematic" class="project-image" transition:name="project-2360-image" />
				</div>
				<h2>The Overview</h2>
				<p>
					Project 2360, internally codenamed Flowserract, is an experimental architectural framework designed to push the boundaries of how AI interacts with application state. It acts as a generative native UI engine that parses natural language prompts to dynamically assemble and render Flutter widgets in real-time.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- The Engineering Challenge -->
		<div data-snap="block" class="show-snap section-block" data-snap-align="fill">
			<h2>The Engineering Challenge</h2>
			<p>
				Current AI applications usually just return text or simple HTML. Flowserract aims to return fully functional, compiled-feeling native components. The challenge lies in translating unstructured AI intent into the strict, typed widget tree required by Flutter, without causing layout shifts, jank, or application crashes.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- The Implementation -->
		<div data-snap="block" class="show-snap section-block" data-snap-align="fill">
			<h2>The Implementation</h2>
			<p>
				By heavily leveraging the <code>llm_json_stream</code> parser, Flowserract listens to raw LLM token streams and instantly compiles them into structural JSON representations of native UI elements. As the AI "thinks" of a layout, the engine is already painting the buttons, containers, and text fields onto the canvas. It is an exploration in bridging complex AI logic directly to low-level component rendering, maintaining strict 60fps animations while the UI literally builds itself.
			</p>
		</div>

	</div>

	<style>
		.project-detail-header {
			width: 100% !important;
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
			gap: 0.75rem;
		}

		.project-mono-label {
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
			opacity: 0.5;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.1em;
			font-weight: 500;
		}

		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			opacity: 0.7;
			margin-top: 0.25rem;
			font-weight: 500;
			line-height: 1.3;
			margin-bottom: 1.25rem !important;
		}

		.project-links {
			display: flex;
			gap: 0.75rem;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		/* Centered and wider content container */
		.project-content-container {
			max-width: 52rem;
			margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 2rem;
			width: 100%;
		}

		.section-block {
			width: 100% !important;
			padding: 2rem;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
			border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
			transition: border-color 150ms var(--ease-out-expo), background-color 150ms var(--ease-out-expo);
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.section-block:hover {
			border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
			background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);
		}

		.section-block h2 {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			font-weight: 600;
			letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			color: var(--text-color);
		}

		.section-block p {
			font-size: 0.98rem;
			line-height: 1.75;
			color: var(--text-color);
			opacity: 0.75;
			text-align: justify;
		}

		/* Float layout wrapper for the inline wrapping */
		.overview-flow-wrapper {
			display: flow-root;
			width: 100%;
		}

		.overview-flow-wrapper h2 {
			margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
		}

		/* Hero image floated right to allow text wrapping inline */
		.hero-image-container {
			float: right;
			width: 320px;
			aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
			margin-left: 2.25rem;
			margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.015);
			border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			overflow: hidden;
			position: relative;
			transition: border-color 150ms var(--ease-out-expo), background-color 150ms var(--ease-out-expo);
		}

		.section-block:hover .hero-image-container {
			border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
			background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
		}

		.project-image {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
			opacity: 0.85;
			mix-blend-mode: multiply;
			transition: opacity 150ms var(--ease-out-expo), transform 150ms var(--ease-out-expo);
		}

		.section-block:hover .project-image {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: scale(1.02);
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			:global(main) {
				padding-left: 1rem !important;
				padding-right: 1rem !important;
			}

			.section-block {
				padding: 1.25rem !important;
			}

			.section-block p {
				text-align: left !important;
			}

			.hero-image-container {
				float: none;
				width: 100%;
				margin-left: 0;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
